---
// Global Telehealth Support Hub: Calibrated for UK, Gulf, US, and Diaspora Families
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white border-t border-brand-navy/5 relative overflow-hidden" id="global-families">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow spheres -->
  <div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-blue-50/40 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl relative z-10">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF7F2] border border-brand-navy/10 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-2xs">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        International Telehealth Practice
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-4">
        Serving Families Across 4 Continents
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Providing immediate, culturally attuned parent guidance and clinical clarity for expatriates, South Asian diaspora families, and parents stranded on lengthy local waiting lists.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Regional Hub Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Hub 1: United Kingdom -->
      <div class="apple-glass-card apple-specular-top p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#FAF7F2]/60 hover-lift">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-2xl">🇬🇧</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-navy bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200">
              London &amp; UK
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">
            NHS CAMHS Waitlist Bridge
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Immediate support for families enduring 18–36 month NHS delays. We provide sensory strategies, home routine restructuring, and SENCO classroom advice right now.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-navy/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Evenings: 4pm – 9pm BST</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hub 2: UAE & Gulf -->
      <div class="apple-glass-card apple-specular-top p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#FAF7F2]/60 hover-lift">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-2xl">🇦🇪</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-navy bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200">
              Dubai &amp; Gulf
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">
            British &amp; IB School Support
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            High-speed ADOS report second opinions and tailored accommodation letters for private international schools in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Doha, and Riyadh.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-navy/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Afternoons: 12pm – 8pm GST</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hub 3: United States & Canada -->
      <div class="apple-glass-card apple-specular-top p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#FAF7F2]/60 hover-lift">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-2xl">🇺🇸</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-navy bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200">
              USA &amp; Canada
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">
            IEP / 504 Accommodation Prep
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            De-jargonize 30-page neuropsychological testing reports. We turn psychometric scores into defensible 504 accommodations and executive function home tools.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-navy/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Mornings: 8am – 1pm EST</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hub 4: South Asian Diaspora -->
      <div class="apple-glass-card apple-specular-top p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#FAF7F2]/60 hover-lift">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-2xl">🌏</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-navy bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200">
              Diaspora Haven
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">
            Bilingual &amp; Stigma-Free Guidance
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Urdu &amp; English fluent consultations. Unpack speech delays, bilingual code-switching, and joint-family expectations in complete psychological safety.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-navy/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Flexible Global Timezones</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Frictionless International Payment & Checkout Reassurance -->
    <div class="apple-glass-card apple-specular-top p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#FAF7F2] border border-brand-navy/10 shadow-xs mb-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100/70 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            1-Click International Checkout
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">
            Global Transparent Rates with Apple Pay, Google Pay &amp; Visa
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Free 15-minute discovery calls require zero payment. For paid consultations ($85 USD / £65), instant payment links are generated via SadaBiz and Payoneer for seamless 1-click checkout from any international bank account.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 shadow-2xs">Apple Pay</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 shadow-2xs">Google Pay</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 shadow-2xs">Visa / Mastercard</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 shadow-2xs">SadaBiz</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Clinical Scope & Safety Callout -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 text-xs text-gray-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Clinical Telehealth Governance:</strong> International consultations focus on parent coaching, developmental strategy planning, and report debriefing. They do not replace local emergency medical services or in-person crisis psychiatric care. All records are protected under international confidentiality standards.
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
